<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Loud</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Home Team</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Crucible Of Life</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3RdO6FKB2of4EddE1Uxlpa</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.630" end="00:10.710">Oh, you love it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.710" end="00:16.790">But something tells me you're afraid of nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.790" end="00:19.470">Oh, you're stunning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.470" end="00:25.550">But let me know that I'm worth the attention</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.550" end="00:27.630">There's about a sixty-six percent chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.630" end="00:30.030">That you would let it all be over so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.030" end="00:32.420">Maybe it's the principles of your past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.420" end="00:34.340">That let it get to you, get to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.340" end="00:36.420">'Cause if it's getting all up under your skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.420" end="00:38.750">Baby, it's a sign you ain't been livin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.750" end="00:42.350">And everyday I'm out here showing you how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.350" end="00:45.060">But you still won't let it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.060" end="00:46.560">Tell 'em baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.550" end="00:49.590">'Cause I love when you get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.590" end="00:51.090">'Cause shit gets crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.910" end="00:53.860">When you make that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.860" end="00:55.360">'Cause you're that lady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.270" end="00:57.430">Who doesn't fuck around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.430" end="00:59.660" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(So don't, don't, don't, don't, don't, don't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.660" end="01:02.590">Don't be afraid to get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.590" end="01:04.390">Tell me baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.390" end="01:06.910">'Cause I love when we get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.910" end="01:08.470">'Cause shit gets crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.470" end="01:11.300">When we make that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.300" end="01:12.800">So do it safely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.510" end="01:14.010">Don't you fuck around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.670" end="01:17.180" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't, don't, don't, don't, don't, don't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.180" end="01:20.830">Don't be afraid to get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.830" end="01:24.110">Please, please, don't be so greedy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.110" end="01:28.900">You understand me when you're underneath me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.900" end="01:31.430">So kick back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.430" end="01:37.580">And say the word when you can really feel that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.580" end="01:39.710">There's about a sixty-six percent chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.710" end="01:41.990">That you would let it all be over so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.990" end="01:44.300">Maybe it's the principles of your past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.300" end="01:46.350">That let it get to you, get to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.350" end="01:48.460">'Cause if it's getting all up under your skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.460" end="01:50.660">Baby, it's a sign you ain't been livin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.660" end="01:54.140">And everyday I'm out here showing you how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.140" end="01:57.270">Don't be afraid to get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.270" end="01:58.770">Tell 'em baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.470" end="02:01.540">'Cause I love when you get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.540" end="02:03.040">'Cause shit gets crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.790" end="02:05.750">When you make that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.750" end="02:07.250">'Cause you're that lady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.190" end="02:09.030">Who doesn't fuck around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.030" end="02:11.830" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(So don't, don't, don't, don't, don't, don't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.830" end="02:14.540">Don't be afraid to get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.540" end="02:16.040">Tell me baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.790" end="02:18.900">'Cause I love when we get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.900" end="02:20.420">'Cause shit gets crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.420" end="02:23.260">When we make that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.260" end="02:24.760">So do it safely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.430" end="02:26.230">Don't you fuck around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.230" end="02:29.260" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't, don't, don't, don't, don't, don't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.260" end="02:33.740">Don't be afraid to get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.740" end="02:38.020">'Cause I love when you get loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.020" end="02:40.860">When you make that sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.860" end="02:42.380">'Cause you're that lady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.380" end="02:43.880">Who doesn't fuck around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.710" end="02:46.660" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't, don't, don't, don't, don't, don't)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.660" end="02:50.660">Don't be afraid to get loud</p></div></body></tt>